THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS

This application bundles and links third-party open-source software under its
own licences, which are unaffected by the notice above. The full list, with
licence texts and source offers, is in docs/licences.md and in the shipped
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt.

Notably, the bundled FFmpeg binaries are GPL-licensed builds (including
libx264, libvpx, libopus and native AAC). They are distributed as separate
executables that the application invokes as child processes, never linked into
the application's own code. Corresponding source is available at
https://ffmpeg.org/download.html and https://git.videolan.org/?p=ffmpeg.git.

